  summary: `# 🦠 Zoonoses #3 — Coronaviruses

## 🎯 Coronavirus family
- **Order:** Nidovirales
- **Family:** Coronaviridae
- **Genera:** Alpha, Beta, Gamma, Delta
- ssRNA positive-sense, ~30 kb (largest RNA genome)
- Distinctive crown-like spikes (Latin "corona")

## 🐅 Three major zoonotic spillovers

| Virus | Year | Origin | Intermediate | CFR |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| SARS-CoV | 2002-03 | Bat | Civet | 10% |
| MERS-CoV | 2012– | Bat | Camel | 35% |
| SARS-CoV-2 | 2019– | Bat | Pangolin?/lab? | ~1% |

## 🦠 SARS-CoV (2002-2003)
- Origin: Guangdong, China
- Intermediate: masked palm civet
- Spread: 8,000 cases, 30 countries, 800 deaths
- Wet market closure → outbreak ended
- No vaccine, no specific treatment

## 🦠 MERS-CoV (2012–)
- Origin: Saudi Arabia
- Reservoir: dromedary camels (high seroprevalence)
- Spread: Middle East, healthcare-associated outbreaks
- South Korea 2015 outbreak (186 cases, 38 deaths)
- CFR ~35%

## 🦠 SARS-CoV-2 (COVID-19, 2019–)
- Origin: Wuhan, China (Dec 2019)
- Receptor: ACE2
- Spike protein → entry
- Variants: Alpha, Beta, Delta, Omicron, etc.
- Pandemic — millions of deaths globally
- Vaccines: mRNA (Pfizer, Moderna), viral vector (AZ, JJ), inactivated (Sinovac, Sinopharm)
- Therapy: Paxlovid, remdesivir, dexamethasone

## 🐶🐱 Animal coronaviruses (vet relevance)
- **Canine coronavirus (CCV)** — enteric, mild
- **Feline coronavirus (FCoV / FIPV)** — mutates → FIP (fatal)
- **Bovine coronavirus** — calf diarrhea + winter dysentery
- **Porcine coronaviruses** — TGE, PED, PDCoV, SADS-CoV
- **Avian infectious bronchitis (IBV)** — gammacoronavirus

## 🐀 SARS-CoV-2 in animals (reverse zoonosis)
- Cats, dogs, ferrets, mink (large mink farm outbreaks DK/NL)
- Tigers, lions (zoo)
- White-tailed deer (USA — sustained transmission!)
- Wildlife reservoir concern

## 🛡️ One Health response
- WHO + WOAH + FAO joint surveillance
- Wildlife trade restrictions
- Live animal market regulation
- Pandemic preparedness (PREPaRE, GOARN)

## 📝 EXAM RECAP
1. ⭐ SARS-CoV: civet intermediate, 2002-03
2. ⭐ MERS-CoV: camel reservoir, ~35% CFR
3. ⭐ SARS-CoV-2: ACE2 receptor, ongoing pandemic
4. ⭐ FIP = mutation of FCoV (cat fatal)
5. ⭐ Mink, deer = SARS-CoV-2 animal reservoirs (concern)`,
